---
description: Never modify local Angular environment.ts
globs: src/environments/**
alwaysApply: true
---

# Environment files

- Never edit, overwrite, regenerate, stage, or commit `src/environments/environment.ts`.
- That file is developer-owned local config.
- Production builds inject only `src/environments/environment.prod.ts` via `scripts/inject-ng-env.mjs`.
- If env values are needed for local work, ask the user; do not rewrite the file.
